          "text": "{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"No complete award itinerary is shown, so I would not treat any of these as ready-to-book recommendations. If January 2 works and you can use United miles, check that lead first: it reports fewer United miles than the January 3 lead. The main tradeoff is that all three award results lack schedules, and their reported seat counts do not confirm availability for your one traveler.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A5@2027-01-02/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"United award lead — January 2\",\"v\":\"This SFO–BKK economy award lead reports 55,000 United miles, USD 24.50 in award taxes, and 9 seats; carriers listed are BR, ET, SQ, UA, and ZH. Against the January 3 United lead, it uses 5,500 fewer United miles, while its reported USD quote is USD 5.50 higher. That is only a raw quote comparison: both quote scopes are unknown, so neither amount establishes a per-traveler or total cost. The source gives date only, not a schedule or full connection details.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A8@2027-01-03/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"United award lead — January 3\",\"v\":\"This is another SFO–BKK economy lead, reporting 60,500 United miles, USD 19.00 in award taxes, and 9 seats, with BR, CA, SQ, UA, and ZH listed. It reports 5,500 more United miles than the January 2 lead but a USD 5.50 lower raw quote; the unknown quote scopes prevent treating that as a total-cost comparison. Its date is shown, but its schedule and full routing are not.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A3@2027-01-01/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"Alaska award lead — January 1\",\"v\":\"If January 1 or Alaska miles are your priority, this SFO–BKK economy lead reports 42,500 Alaska miles, USD 50.90 in award taxes, and 8 seats; AS and JX are listed as carriers. Its points are in a different program from the United leads, so they are not directly comparable. The USD quote scope is unknown, and the result gives no schedule or full connection details.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"Across these three leads, the source reports economy awards and seat counts, but does not return traveler counts; availability for your one traveler is therefore unverified. It also does not specify the cabin on every leg. Confirm current availability, itinerary details, and fees with the booking program before relying on a lead.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-01T22:55-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash baseline — January 1\",\"v\":\"The separate cash reference is a one-stop Cathay Pacific itinerary via HKG, departing SFO January 1 at 10:55 p.m. local time and arriving in BKK January 4 at 10:35 a.m. local time; reported duration is 44 hours 40 minutes. Its source quote is USD 640.00, with unknown quote scope, so it is not established as a per-traveler or all-in amount and should not be compared as a like-for-like total against the award-tax quotes.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"The search results show no complete selectable award journey, and the broader search was partial. These leads are limited examples, not a complete inventory; check the booking sites for current availability and details.\"}]}",
